 224:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal.c ****   *        Tick interrupt priority.
 225:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal.c ****   * @note This function is called  automatically at the beginning of program after
 226:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal.c ****   *       reset by HAL_Init() or at any time when clock is reconfigured  by HAL_RCC_ClockConfig().
 227:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal.c ****   * @note In the default implementation, SysTick timer is the source of time base.
