 229:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal.c ****   *       Care must be taken if HAL_Delay() is called from a peripheral ISR process,
 230:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal.c ****   *       The SysTick interrupt must have higher priority (numerically lower)
